?"] ["question-dde847bc-5ddb-54de-88c5-81b18b2aa0d0" :question/worked-solution "Let $X$ represent the height of water in a random inspection of the dam. From the problem statement, we know that $X∼U[120,195],$ and we wish to compute $\\text{E}[X].$\n\nIn general, if $X∼U[a,b],$ then $X$ has the following expected value:\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X]=\\frac{a+b}{2}\n$$\n\nSo, for our random variable $X∼U[120,195],$ we have the following expected value:\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X]=\\frac{120+195}{2}=157.5\n$$\n\nTherefore, the mean height of water in the dam is $157.5\\,\\text{m}.$"] ["question-dde847bc-5ddb-54de-88c5-81b18b2aa0d0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-b332393b-467d-57f6-86e8-201567c24b59" :answer-field/id #uuid "b332393b-467d-57f6-86e8-201567c24b59"] ["answer-5881b8aa-fa36-5d7c-81f9-47ae6f95c700" :answer/id #uuid "5881b8aa-fa36-5d7c-81f9-47ae6f95c700"] ["answer-5881b8aa-fa36-5d7c-81f9-47ae6f95c700" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-5881b8aa-fa36-5d7c-81f9-47ae6f95c700" :answer/value "120.5\\,\\text{m}"] ["answer-2e690e66-2b08-578a-8669-8a4559b8135b" :answer/id #uuid "2e690e66-2b08-578a-8669-8a4559b8135b"] ["answer-2e690e66-2b08-578a-8669-8a4559b8135b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-2e690e66-2b08-578a-8669-8a4559b8135b" :answer/value "155.5\\,\\text{m}"] ["answer-ff61f4a5-fdc7-50ac-8e2e-f37f8b83242a" :answer/id #uuid "ff61f4a5-fdc7-50ac-8e2e-f37f8b83242a"] ["answer-ff61f4a5-fdc7-50ac-8e2e-f37f8b83242a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-ff61f4a5-fdc7-50ac-8e2e-f37f8b83242a" :answer/value "157.5\\,\\text{m}"] ["answer-540a4c2f-1c8b-54a6-871e-f1146cfd3188" :answer/id #uuid "540a4c2f-1c8b-54a6-871e-f1146cfd3188"] ["answer-540a4c2f-1c8b-54a6-871e-f1146cfd3188" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-540a4c2f-1c8b-54a6-871e-f1146cfd3188" :answer/value "195\\,\\text{m}"] ["answer-654974a1-1f54-5eaa-88ed-8f82bc70ce92" :answer/id #uuid "654974a1-1f54-5eaa-88ed-8f82bc70ce92"] ["answer-654974a1-1f54-5eaa-88ed-8f82bc70ce92" :answer